created: 2023-06-20, last updated: 2026-06-03, [Read more](https://github.com/mem0ai/mem0/blob/main/mem0-plugin/skills/mem0/references/use-cases.md)

Keep memories separate using `user_id`, `agent_id`, `app_id`, and `run_id` scoping.
Critical for multi-agent workflows and multi-tenant apps.
